sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant Tray as kiro-tray agent
    participant Admin as /admin API
    participant CLI as kiro-cli
    participant SSO as Identity provider

    User->>Tray: click "Login to Kiro CLI"
    Tray->>Admin: POST /admin/login
    Admin->>CLI: kiro-cli login --use-device-flow
    CLI-->>Admin: device code + verification URL
    Admin-->>Tray: login started
    Tray-->>User: notify "Approve in browser"
    User->>SSO: approve device code
    SSO-->>CLI: token issued
    CLI-->>Admin: login success
    Tray->>Admin: GET /admin/login/status (poll)
    Admin-->>Tray: returncode 0
    Tray-->>User: notify "Logged in" + dot turns green
